<title>USA: Morgan Stanley Russia IPO filing effective.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley Russia IPO filing effective.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Russia &amp; New Europe Fund Inc said on Wednesday its filing for an initial public offering was declared effective by the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>The closed-end fund said it is offering five million shares of its common, and an additional 750,000 shares are available to cover over-allotments.</p>
<p>The offering price is $20 per share.</p>
</text>
